<.shell title="Messages" current={:feedback}>
  <h1>Messages</h1>
  <p class="lead">Tell people what happened, what's important, and what to do next.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Toast</strong>: the result of what the person did. It comes and goes.
    </li>
    <li><strong>Banner</strong>: something true about the page until it changes. It stays.</li>
    <li><strong>Error summary</strong>: what to fix in a form after a failed save.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Toasts</h2>
  <p>
    LiveView's flash messages. One card per message, stacked at the top right on a desktop and at
    the bottom on a phone, where a thumb can close it.
  </p>
  <div class="demo">
    <div class="toast-stack">
      <div class="toast" role="status">
        <.svg_icon name="check-circle" size={20} />
        <div class="body">4 attendance changes saved to D4H.</div>
        <button class="close" aria-label="Close"><.svg_icon name="x-mark" size={20} /></button>
      </div>
      <div class="toast info" role="status">
        <.svg_icon name="information-circle" size={20} />
        <div class="body">Refresh started. It takes about a minute.</div>
        <button class="close" aria-label="Close"><.svg_icon name="x-mark" size={20} /></button>
      </div>
      <div class="toast error" role="alert">
        <.svg_icon name="exclamation-circle" size={20} />
        <div class="body">
          <span class="title">D4H did not accept the change</span>
          Nothing changed. Check the D4H access key in team settings.
        </div>
        <button class="close" aria-label="Close"><.svg_icon name="x-mark" size={20} /></button>
      </div>
      <div class="toast connection" role="status">
        <span class="spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <div class="body">
          <span class="title">Reconnecting</span>
          The connection to SAR Duty dropped. Your changes are kept.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="actions">
    <button class="btn secondary" data-toast="success">Show a success toast</button>
    <button class="btn secondary" data-toast="error">Show an error toast</button>
  </div>
  <ul>
    <li>Success and info toasts close after 5 seconds. Error toasts stay until closed.</li>
    <li>Body text only for success and info. Errors get a short title, then what to do.</li>
    <li>The connection toast shows while LiveView reconnects and goes when it is back.</li>
    <li>Never put the only copy of important information in a toast. Use a banner.</li>
  </ul>
  <div class="toasts" id="toasts" aria-live="polite"></div>
  <template id="toast-success">
    <div class="toast" role="status">
      <.svg_icon name="check-circle" size={20} />
      <div class="body">Settings saved.</div>
      <button class="close" aria-label="Close"><.svg_icon name="x-mark" size={20} /></button>
    </div>
  </template>
  <template id="toast-error">
    <div class="toast error" role="alert">
      <.svg_icon name="exclamation-circle" size={20} />
      <div class="body">
        <span class="title">Letter not created</span>
        Enter who authorizes tax letters in team settings.
      </div>
      <button class="close" aria-label="Close"><.svg_icon name="x-mark" size={20} /></button>
    </div>
  </template>
  <script>
    document.querySelectorAll("[data-toast]").forEach(function (button) {
      button.addEventListener("click", function () {
        var kind = button.dataset.toast;
        var toast = document.getElementById("toast-" + kind).content.firstElementChild.cloneNode(true);
        document.getElementById("toasts").appendChild(toast);
        toast.querySelector(".close").addEventListener("click", function () { toast.remove(); });
        if (kind !== "error") setTimeout(function () { toast.remove(); }, 5000);
      });
    });
  </script>

  <h2>Confirm dialog</h2>
  <p>
    Before a change that cannot be undone. The title asks the question and names the thing. The
    buttons say what happens; Cancel is the default.
  </p>
  <div class="demo">
    <div class="dialog dialog-static" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="confirm-title-static">
      <h2 id="confirm-title-static">Delete the First Aid clause?</h2>
      <p>
        Its 3 qualifications are removed from the group rule. Members stay in the group until you apply the rule.
      </p>
      <div class="actions">
        <button class="btn danger">Delete clause</button>
        <button class="btn secondary" autofocus>Cancel</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="actions">
    <button class="btn secondary" data-open-dialog="confirm">Show the dialog</button>
  </div>
  <dialog class="dialog" id="confirm" aria-labelledby="confirm-title">
    <h2 id="confirm-title">Delete the First Aid clause?</h2>
    <p>
      Its 3 qualifications are removed from the group rule. Members stay in the group until you apply the rule.
    </p>
    <form method="dialog" class="actions">
      <button class="btn danger" value="delete">Delete clause</button>
      <button class="btn secondary" value="cancel" autofocus>Cancel</button>
    </form>
  </dialog>
  <script>
    document.querySelectorAll("[data-open-dialog]").forEach(function (button) {
      button.addEventListener("click", function () {
        document.getElementById(button.dataset.openDialog).showModal();
      });
    });
  </script>

  <h2>Banners</h2>
  <p>At the top of the page, under the header. One at a time.</p>
  <div class="banner success" role="status">
    <div class="banner-title"><.svg_icon name="check-circle" size={20} />Success</div>
    <div class="banner-body">
      <p><strong>12 tax credit letters created for 2025.</strong></p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="banner" role="region" aria-label="Important">
    <div class="banner-title"><.svg_icon name="information-circle" size={20} />Important</div>
    <div class="banner-body">
      <p>
        SAR Duty refreshes from D4H every night at 02:00. Changes made in D4H today show up tomorrow.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="banner warning" role="region" aria-label="Warning">
    <div class="banner-title"><.svg_icon name="exclamation-triangle" size={20} />Warning</div>
    <div class="banner-body">
      <p>
        The team's D4H access key belongs to a person. If they leave the team, it stops working.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="banner danger" role="alert">
    <div class="banner-title">
      <.svg_icon name="exclamation-circle" size={20} />D4H is not answering
    </div>
    <div class="banner-body">
      <p>Nothing changed. Try again in a few minutes.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>Error summary</h2>
  <p>
    At the top of a form after a failed save, linking to each field. See <a href={
      page_path(:forms)
    }>Forms</a>.
  </p>
  <div class="error-summary" role="alert">
    <h2>There is a problem</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="#">Enter who authorizes tax letters</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <h2>Warning text</h2>
  <div class="warning-text">
    <.svg_icon name="exclamation-triangle" size={24} />
    <span>Attendance cannot be changed once the activity is published in D4H.</span>
  </div>
  <p class="spec">For a consequence people must know before they act.</p>

  <h2>Inset text</h2>
  <div class="inset">
    Members are matched by name, email, or phone. You review every change before it's made.
  </div>
  <p class="spec">For a note that helps, set apart from the main text.</p>

  <h2>Empty state</h2>
  <div class="empty">
    <strong>No tax credit letters for 2025 yet</strong>
    <p>Letters are made from attendance in D4H. Create one from the member list.</p>
    <a href="#" class="btn sm secondary">Go to tax credit letters</a>
  </div>
  <p class="spec">Say why it's empty and what to do, not only "No results".</p>

  <h2>Loading</h2>
  <div class="demo">
    <p><span class="spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span> Refreshing from D4H…</p>
    <p class="small muted">
      <span class="spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      Calculating driving distances for 14 members…
    </p>
  </div>
  <p class="spec">
    Name the slow thing. Spinners slow down when the system asks for reduced motion.
  </p>
</.shell>
